*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0003
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-03-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 108
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0003.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> CHANNEL O=ONLINE B=BRANCH A=ATM
    05 CHNL-CD            PIC X.
    *> CARD PRESENT Y/N
    05 CARD-PRES-FLG      PIC X.
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TXN-AMT            PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 TXN-HOLD-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 REVIEW-FLAG        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM ONLINE-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "TXN-HOLD-IND=" TXN-HOLD-IND
    DISPLAY "REVIEW-FLAG=" REVIEW-FLAG
    STOP RUN.
ONLINE-SCREEN.
    IF CHNL-CD = 'O'
        *> CARD-NOT-PRESENT ONLINE PURCHASE - LIMIT 750 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF CARD-PRES-FLG = 'N' AND TXN-AMT > 1000
            MOVE 'Y' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
            MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
        *> LARGE ONLINE TRANSACTION - LIMIT 8750 PER 1998 POLICY
        ELSE IF TXN-AMT > 17500.00
            MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
        END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
    END-IF.
